      "id": "claim_f1443a224d6e4c0387846ec7011fd8c2",
      "statement": "_document_batches shards each parquet file across DDP ranks by row group (rank, rank+world_size, ...), yields document lists with a (pq_idx, rg_idx, epoch) position, wraps to the first file incrementing epoch, and on resume advances one row-group stride past the recorded position to avoid repeating data.",
