    {
      "id": "claim_ef1df66baad544f2aa8ce0536c213642",
      "statement": "The BOS-aligned best-fit dataloader prepends BOS to every document, keeps a buffer of about 1000 tokenised documents, fills each row of capacity T+1 with the largest fitting document and crops the shortest buffered document when nothing fits, yielding 100%-utilised rows with no padding at the cost of roughly 35% cropped tokens.",
